The tiny little goblins could not keep up and you escaped. 
[[Wander]]
<audio src = "https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/733/733465_15919059-lq.mp3" autoplay/>


:: Sit down and cry {"position":"700,450","size":"100,100"}
Well that was boring. Aliens take you and you are frozen forever.
<c class = "smallCap">(Good luck finding the back button)</c>
<div class = "mainImages">
<img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSdK8wBBnp50_VnG86Bpg-CJDOEwXZ6XHl7BcT-AR26zR7O55sfXbwQwf0f&s=10"/>
</div>
<p class = "centCap">($nameInp - Dead because they did nothing)</p>
<audio src = "https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/841/841370_18320024-lq.mp3" autoplay />
(enchant: ?page, (background:white))


:: Wander {"position":"975,750","size":"100,100"}
{(if: (history:) contains "a machete") [
<div class = "photos">
<img src = "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcS1Gz6564yXeSDDNWnZE7peuBN6OonyTd8yVHcohqishA&s=10" width = "50px" height = "50px"/>
