</div>
]
<c class="smallCap">HP: $hp</c>
}
(if: $randW % 2 is 0)[
    You wander further around the dungeon. As you wander, you encounter ANOTHER horde of goblins with knives coming at you. (They look very similar too)

<div style = "display: flex" >
<img src = "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcS1Gz6564yXeSDDNWnZE7peuBN6OonyTd8yVHcohqishA&s=10" width = 100px" />

<img src = "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTvZeQs4RjNSrChGzkFwIwQ2V3jssLnBxT0Yd6GbJHljw&s=10" width = "400px" />
</div>
(set: $randW to $randW + 1)
[[Run for your life]]
[[Attack them! They're just little goblins!]]
<audio src = "https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/521/521417_10962806-lq.mp3" autoplay/>
]
(else:)[
    You get back to walking. After a while longer of wandering, you encounter the tutorial guild entrance. 
    (set: $randW to $randW + 1)
[[Enter Tutorial Guild]]
[[Expore More->Wander]]
[[Run Away ->Ignore Tutorial Guild]]
<audio src = "https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/733/733465_15919059-lq.mp3" autoplay/>
]


:: a machete {"position":"1050,525","size":"100,100"}
<div class = "photos">
<img src = "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcS1Gz6564yXeSDDNWnZE7peuBN6OonyTd8yVHcohqishA&s=10" width = "50px" height = "50px"/>
</div>
<c class="smallCap">HP: $hp</c>
You enter the dungeon and it explains you must beat 18 floors to escape. You must also find a tutorial guild to be able to progress. As you wander, you encounter a horde of goblins with knives coming at you. 

